function EnumeratePrimeCongruences(S, c):
    result = ∅
    for partition in Partitions(S):
        R = EquivRelation(partition)
        if IsClosureCongruence(R, c) and IsPrime(R, c):
            result.add(R)
    return result

Complexity: O(B(|S|) · |S|^|Vars| · |φ|)
where B(n) is the Bell number
